join="round" class="size-full"><line y1="12" y2="12" opacity="0" x1="15" x2="15"></line><line y1="8" y2="12" x1="11" x2="15"></line><line y1="16" y2="12" x1="11" x2="15"></line></svg></span></a><a data-fill="soft" data-analytics-id="docs-try-playground-cta" data-analytics-pathname="/developers/tools/web-search" href="https://console.x.ai/team/default/chat?utm_source=docs&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=developers-tools-web-search&amp;utm_content=playground-cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="relative isolate inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border-0 text-sm font-medium transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow] duration-150 outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary/30 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;&gt;[data-slot=icon]]:-mx-0.5 [&amp;&gt;[data-slot=icon]]:shrink-0 rounded-full bg-(--btn-bg) text-(--btn-text) hover:bg-(--btn-hover) [--btn-bg:color-mix(in_srgb,hsl(var(--primary))_3%,hsl(var(--bg-card)))] [--btn-hover:color-mix(in_srgb,hsl(var(--primary))_7%,hsl(var(--bg-card)))] [--btn-text:var(--color-primary)] h-10 gap-x-3 px-[18px] py-2.5 text-sm leading-5 [&amp;&gt;[data-slot=icon]]:size-4 shrink-0"><span class="absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 size-[max(100%,2.75rem)] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 [@media(pointer:fine)]:hidden" aria-hidden="true"></span>Try Playground</a><a href="https://x.ai/news/grok-4-7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="border-solar/25 text-solar hover:border-solar/40 group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-x-2 rounded-full border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-300">Meet grok-4.7<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" stroke-width="2" class="size-4 opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"><path d="M17 15.5V7M17 7L8.5 7.00002M17 7L7 17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square"></path></svg></a></div></div></span><p>The Web Search tool enables Grok to search the web in real-time and browse web pages to find information. This powerful tool allows the model to search the internet, access web pages, and extract relevant information to answer queries with up-to-date content.</p><hr/><span class="not-prose"><h2 id="sdk-support" class="scroll-mt-28 transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out lg:scroll-mt-24 text-primary font-display text-balance text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-3xl mb-4 mt-12"><a class="not-prose" href="#sdk-support">SDK Support</a></h2></span><div class="not-prose my-6 w-full overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm [&amp;_thead_tr]:border-border [&amp;_thead_tr]:border-b [&amp;_th]:text-secondary [&amp;_th]:px-3 [&amp;_th]:py-2.5 [&amp;_th]:text-left [&amp;_th]:align-bottom [&amp;_th]:text-sm [&amp;_th]:font-light [&amp;_tbody]:divide-border [&amp;_tbody]:divide-y [&amp;_td]:px-3 [&amp;_td]:py-4 [&amp;_td]:align-top [&amp;_td:first-child]:text-primary [&amp;_td:first-child]:font-medium [&amp;_td:first-child]:!pl-0 [&amp;_th:first-child]:!pl-0 [&amp;_td_li]:before:text-subtle [&amp;_td_li]:before:mr-1.5 [&amp;_td_li]:before:content-[&quot;•&quot;] [&amp;_td_ul]:m-0 [&amp;_td_ul]:list-none [&amp;_td_ul]:space-y-1.5 [&amp;_td_ul]:p-0 [&amp;_tbody_tr:last-child_td]:border-b-0"><thead><tr><th>SDK/API</th><th>Tool Name</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>xAI SDK</td><td><span class="not-prose"><code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] text-solar">web_search</code></span></td></tr><tr><td>OpenAI Responses API</td><td><span class="not-prose"><code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] text-solar">web_search</code></span></td></tr><tr><td>Vercel AI SDK</td><td><span class="not-prose"><code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] text-solar">xai.tools.webSearch()</code></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>This tool is also supported in all Responses API compatible SDKs.</p><hr/><span class="not-prose"><h2 id="basic-usage" class="scroll-mt-28 transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out lg:scroll-mt-24 text-primary font-display text-balance text-2xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-3xl mb-4 mt-12"><a class="not-prose" href="#basic-usage">Basic Usage</a></h2></span><span class="not-prose"><div class="relative flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl bg-l1 text-fg border mb-5" style="overflow-anchor:none"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b px-4 py-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4" style="overflow-anchor:auto"><div dir="ltr" data-orientation="horizontal" data-slot="tabs"><div role="tablist" aria-orientation="horizontal" data-slot="tabs-list" class="relative text-xs flex flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-x-1 gap-y-1 border-0 bg-transparent p-0" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" style="outline:none"><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="radix-_R_h99qnpfiumbsnppfkmlb_-content-javascriptAISDK" data-state="active" id="radix-_R_h99qnpfiumbsnppfkmlb_-trigger-javascriptAISDK" data-slot="tabs-trigger" class="mb-0 inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 text-muted data-[state=active]:text-primary shadow-[none] rounded-xl px-2 py-1 text-xs" tabindex="-1" data-orientation="horizontal" data-radix-collection-item=""><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4"><path d="M12.0001 3.68628L21.6001 20.3135H2.40015L12.0001 3.68628Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> JavaScript</span></button><button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="radix-_R_h99qnpfiumbsnppfkmlb_-content-pythonOpenAISDK" data-state="inactive" id="radix-_R_h99qnpfiumbsnppfkmlb_-trigger-pythonOpenAISDK" data-slot="tabs-trigger" class="mb-0 inline-flex items-center just