e_search</code></span></td><td>Enable image search results that can be embedded in responses</td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class="not-prose"><h3 id="only-search-in-specific-domains" class="scroll-mt-28 transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out lg:scroll-mt-24 text-primary font-display text-xl leading-snug tracking-tight sm:text-2xl mb-3 mt-10"><a class="not-prose" href="#only-search-in-specific-domains">Only Search in Specific Domains</a></h3></span><p>Use <span class="not-prose"><code class="font-mono text-[0.95em] text-solar">allowed_domains</code></span> to make the web search <strong>only</strong> perform the search and web browsing on web pages that fall within the specified domains.</p><span class="not-prose"><div class="[&amp;_a]:decoration-current/50 bg-card my-5 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 font-sans text-xs leading-5 [&amp;_a]:text-inherit [&amp;_a]:underline text-primary flex flex-row items-start gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 ml-0 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0 self-start"><div class="flex-shrink-0"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-slot="icon" class="stroke-[2] size-3.5 text-[#999] dark:text-[#555]"><g id="name=info-circle"><g id="vector"><path d="M12 11.0996C12.4971 11.0996 12.9004 11.5029 12.9004 12V16.5H11.0996V12.9004H10.5V11.0996H12Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M12 7.40039C12.6626 7.40039 13.2 7.93706 13.2002 8.59961C13.2002 9.26235 12.6627 9.7998 12 9.7998C11.3373 9.79978 10.7998 9.26233 10.7998 8.59961C10.8 7.93707 11.3374 7.40042 12 7.40039Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C17.5228 2 22 6.47715 22 12C22 17.5228 17.5228 22 12 22C6.47715 22 2 17.5228 2 12C2 6.47715 6.47715 2 12 2ZM12 4C7.58172 4 4 7.58172 4 12C4 16.4183 7.58172 20 12 20C16.4183 20 20 16.4183 20 12C20 7.58172 16.4183 4 12 4Z" fill="currentColor"></path></g></g></svg></div></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1 [&amp;&gt;p:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;p:last-child